Package: simple-uploader
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Kerry Ritter <kerry@example.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, wl-clipboard, xclip
Description: Upload clipboard contents to S3-compatible storage
 Confirm clipboard images, videos, files, text, or Markdown in a small GTK
 dialog, upload to S3/R2/B2/MinIO, and copy the public URL to the clipboard.
 Supports Wayland and X11, with shortcut setup for COSMIC and GNOME.
